item.description:
&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are doing good work. You are blessed. The world is flourishing because of you. The gods are happy. Gratitude to you Vanessa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beautifully written wisdom of the ages - thank you for sharing this beautiful story&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It seems to me that most of us take too long before we hear this story. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;May thanks for sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is such a beautiful text. Thank you for writing it. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://decolonialfutures.net/portfolio/fourmountains/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://decolonialfutures.net/portfolio/fourmountains/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Awesome, we all need constant awareness, thanks for sharing this story. Now we know then it&#039;s time to look up and go forward .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;
